WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
An original, code-rendered visual explanation. The title words land on the beat.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:12.000
Picture events sit on a beat grid measured from the final mix, at 100 beats per minute.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.800
Named motion: nodes pop in, then a parcel winds up before it moves.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.400
Follow-through: the tail settles after the body stops. Then a label decodes and locks.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.600
A looping asset, four beats long: float, shimmer and pulse return exactly to the first frame.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:32.000
Interactive visuals + visualization videos. By Lex from SigmaStudioz.
